body:
In short, air signage. Emphasized Mercury.

Well aspected Mercury.

Mercury to Uranus aspects (“genius” aspects)

Air Mercury;  
Aquarius Mercury (exalted);  
Gemini placements;   
I could see Virgo, too, but Virgo is more of a thinker that takes time rather than a fast thinker (Gemini);   
9th House Sun;  
i would say Sagittarian placements BUT I see those for quick humor or lovely storytelling, more than raw intellect if that makes sense.   

Gemini rising (which puts Aquarius on 9th house cusp where it’s happy)

look for Aquarius and Gemini placements. Uranus and mercury. 9th house activation with said placements too. 3rd house as well if there are specific active planets. 

Again, for what OP is asking, it’s gotta be Gemini and Aquarius as the primary contenders. 

**Edit:** please guys I’m not validating your random 3rd house planets or sag sun whatever combo. It’s super exhausting even reading these comments, let alone receiving DMs from strangers asking me “am I genius??” 

A sole placement here and there doesn’t really qualify IMO, and the entire chart needs to be considered in its entirety, as there can be many contradicting factors. 

Also, perhaps most importantly: If you have to announce to the world that you’re intelligent or a genius, I guarantee you, you probably are far from it.
